Scope statement. No experiments, physical tests, coding exercises, or data collections have been conducted in the preparation of this document or of any prior version. The appendices specify proof obligations, templates, and protocols. Where a table or example appears, its values are placeholders for format illustration and are not measurements. The framework is a theoretical programme; the appendices are the instruments by which it would be tested, not evidence that it has been.

